# A scry counts as well as a surveil: Bot1 casts Preordain, keeps both cards on top, and then attacks with the Phantasm
# (its controller's scry, so the permission is on, CR 702.3b). The permission is for this creature only: Sylvan Caryatid,
# also a defender, still may not attack (the refusal).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Surveillance Phantasm
Sylvan Caryatid
Preordain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
