Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Preordain.Cast
Bot1.Arrange(Island; Island)
? Stack.Count = 0
! Bot1.Attack(Sylvan Caryatid > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Surveillance Phantasm > Bot2)
